# CookieFirst

Cookie consent management platform (CMP) for GDPR, ePrivacy, CCPA, LGPD, Law 25, and PDPA compliance. Google Certified CMP offering automated cookie scanning, consent banners, policy generation in 40+ languages, and Google Consent Mode v2 integration.

CookieFirst is a consent management platform that helps websites comply with international privacy regulations by managing cookie consent, blocking third-party scripts before consent, and providing automated compliance tools for businesses of all sizes.

