[Cookie Consent Manager](https://cookiefirst.com): Main product overview and capabilities[Platform Features](https://cookiefirst.com/cookie-consent-manager-features/): Detailed feature breakdown including third-party script management, consent audit trails, cross-domain consent, and re-consent optimization[Cookie Banner](https://cookiefirst.com/cookie-banner/): Customizable GDPR-compliant cookie banners[Cookie Scanner](https://cookiefirst.com/cookie-scanner/): Automated monthly cookie and local storage scanning[Cookie Policy Generator](https://cookiefirst.com/cookie-policy-generator/): Automated policy generation in 40+ languages[Consent Management Platform](https://cookiefirst.com/consent-management-platform/): Comprehensive consent management capabilities[Google Consent Mode](https://cookiefirst.com/google-consent-mode/): Google Certified CMP with Consent Mode v2 integration

